{
  "description": "Nightly self-development bot (docs/nightly-self-development.md section 4.1; issues #742, #771). Install: mkdir -p ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-~/.config}/mercury/bots && cp deploy/nightly-bot.json.example ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-~/.config}/mercury/bots/nightly.json, then 'mercury host bot validate --alias nightly'. All tasks use tz 'local': the host must run Europe/Warsaw so 'local' is Poznan time (parseTz has no IANA names, and a fixed offset like '+01:00' would miss the EU DST switch inside the 00:00-06:00 window). e2e and next end at notAfterAt '06:00' local on the fire date (the \u00a74.3 window); the report fires 06:05 (just after the window it digests) and ends at '07:00'.",
  "api": {
    "url": "http://127.0.0.1:4620",
    "timeoutMs": 30000
  },
  "schedule": {
    "tasks": [
      {
        "name": "nightly-e2e",
        "cron": "5 0 * * *",
        "tz": "local",
        "singleFlight": true,
        "onMiss": "skip",
        "template": {
          "task": "nightly-e2e {{fire.date}}: run the E2E suite per .agents/skills/nightly/SKILL.md (e2e.ts); file or update defect issues, never fix them in this Run; never ask; stay inside the 06:00 window.",
          "notAfterAt": "06:00",
          "constraints": {
            "maxDurationMs": 14400000,
            "maxRetries": 0
          },
          "skills": []
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "nightly-next",
        "cron": "*/20 0-4 * * *",
        "tz": "local",
        "singleFlight": true,
        "onMiss": "skip",
        "template": {
          "task": "nightly-next {{fire.date}} {{fire.time}}: take the top rung of the nightly ladder per .agents/skills/nightly/SKILL.md (next.ts); finish or mark blocked; never ask; stay inside the 06:00 window.",
          "notAfterAt": "06:00",
          "constraints": {
            "maxDurationMs": 4800000,
            "maxRetries": 0
          },
          "skills": [
            "issue-fix-loop",
            "testing"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "nightly-report",
        "cron": "5 6 * * *",
        "tz": "local",
        "singleFlight": true,
        "onMiss": "skip",
        "template": {
          "task": "nightly-report {{fire.date}}: file the morning digest of the night that just ended ([00:00, 06:00) local) per .agents/skills/nightly/SKILL.md (report.ts); report only, never fix; never ask; finish before 07:00.",
          "notAfterAt": "07:00",
          "constraints": {
            "maxDurationMs": 900000,
            "maxRetries": 0
          },
          "skills": []
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
